    <string name="support_title">Support Development</string>
    <string name="support_body">If you find Mi5G Prayer useful, you can support the developer @midroid5G to help keep the app free and ad-free:</string>
    <string name="support_paypal_btn">💙 Support on PayPal (@Midroid5G)</string>
    <string name="about_title">About</string>
    <string name="version_fmt">Version %1$s</string>
    <string name="privacy_title">Privacy</string>
    <string name="privacy_body">The app collects and sends no data. It has no internet permission, no ads and no analytics. Approximate location (if you allow it) is used on your device only to pick the city and is stored only as coordinates in the app settings. Your own sound file is read on your device only.</string>
    <string name="adhan_attr_title">Adhan recording</string>
    <string name="adhan_attr_body">Default adhan: “أجمل صوت الآذان بدون حقوق” from the YouTube channel “بيت المسلم - Muslim House” (published 2022-03-27).\nLicence: standard YouTube licence; the uploader’s description states it is “بدون حقوق” (“no rights”) and “جميع الحقوق محفوظة لكل مسلم” (“all rights reserved for every Muslim”). Included at the app owner’s choice.\nModified: audio extracted, silence trimmed, loudness normalised.</string>
    <string name="source_link">Source: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rp1FyMSxehE</string>
    <string name="other_credits">Other credits</string>
    <string name="other_credits_body">• Prayer-time calculation: adhan-java 1.2.1 (Batoul Apps) — MIT licence.\n• Omani city coordinates: GeoNames — CC BY 4.0.\n• Times verified against: Ministry of Endowments &amp; Religious Affairs calendar (mara.gov.om).\n• Chime: generated by this project — CC0.</string>
